The model inference path must not allocate heap memory.

The rest of the daemon may use bounded preallocated memory structures, but all resource limits must be explicit.

### 9.2 Classification states

Implement three logical outcomes:

| State | Classifier mark | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Gaming | `0x40/0xF0` | Prioritize |
| Verified non-gaming | `0x10/0xF0` | Stop sampling |
| Unknown | `0x00/0xF0` | Leave unclassified |

Use confidence thresholds based on validation results.

Do not classify uncertain predictions as verified non-gaming.

### 9.3 Conntrack integration

Use masked conntrack mark updates.

Reserve:

```c
